<title>AUSTRIA: Radex 9-mth profit up, sales down slightly.</title>
<headline>Radex 9-mth profit up, sales down slightly.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to end September.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						    1996	    1995</p>
<p>    Group sales				15,781	  15,920</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit			405	     377</p>
<p>    Group net				     325	     246</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Radex-Heraklith Industriebeteiligungs AG. The firm said in a statement it expected a 10 percent increase in full-year earnings.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
